            "review_title": "Review at SO DELICIOUS FROG",
            "review_text": "Amanda_Kearsley\nSheffield, United Kingdom8 contributions\n0\n1st time frogs legs!!\nApr 2015 • Couples\nWent to this restaurant on our first night in nha trang and we were not disappointed. the staff and chef could not do enough for us and explained the different variety of dishes. We had frogs legs in passion fruit sauce and prawn curry both of which were amazing. We also had two beers each and the bill was so cheap! We would definitely recommend this restaurant to anyone visiting nha trang!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 29, 2015",
