            "review_title": "Review at SO DELICIOUS FROG",
            "review_text": "Jennifer A\nCuenca, Ecuador6 contributions\n0\nTender, juicy and So Delicious\nApr 2015 • Couples\nGrowing up in South Louisiana I have eaten more than my share of frog legs. And during my travels I sometimes try my luck at frog legs and more often than not I am disappointed by rubbery, tough fare. NOT AT SO DELICIOUS FROG!\n\nWe had deep fried frog legs in butter which was rich and delicious and melted in your mouth. Also we had frog legs fried in salted egg which was also world class and delicious. (There are numerous ways that they serve their specialty (Deep fried, Grilled, Stewed, Stir-Fried, Porridge, and Hot Pot) and each method has several spices or styles to try. If you can think of a way to have frog legs then odds are So Delicious Frog makes it.\n\nIf you've ever thought you'd like to try frog legs then this is the place to do so. You will enjoy every bite and the taste and extremely reasonable price will have you coming back again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 17, 2015",
